<title>UK: Lehman leads 5-tranche bond for Norwest Auto Trust.</title>
<headline>Lehman leads 5-tranche bond for Norwest Auto Trust.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers and Norwest Investments have jointly lead-managed a $1.064 billion five-tranche asset-backed bond for Norwest Auto Trust 1996-A.  </p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A1</p>
<p> AMT    $350 MLN	SPREAD     -7 BP     LEG MAT     08.DEC.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 5M LIBOR  EXP MAT     15.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   L13.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 LISTING    UNLISTED  L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A2</p>
<p> AMT    $340 MLN	COUPON     5.80 PCT  LEG MAT     15.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.9784   EXP MAT     15.JUL.98</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A3</p>
<p> AMT    $220 MLN	COUPON     5.9 PCT   LEG MAT     15.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.9131   EXP MAT     15.JUN.99</p>
